# Device-local overrides and secrets
*.local.json
*.local.jsonc
*.local.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Fleet is the live OpenCode config root when OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR points
# at fleet/ (see README). Private runtime siblings (service.json,
# cli.json, auth files, a competing opencode.json, logs, dumps) live on
# disk under fleet/ but must stay out of Git. Deny by default; allow
# only the intended tracked config/agents/skills/commands/instructions.
# A skill's supporting files need an explicit exception here if added.
fleet/*
!fleet/opencode.jsonc
!fleet/AGENTS.md
!fleet/agents/
fleet/agents/*
!fleet/agents/*.md
!fleet/commands/
fleet/commands/*
!fleet/commands/*.md
!fleet/skills/
!fleet/skills/*/
fleet/skills/*/*
!fleet/skills/*/SKILL.md
!fleet/skills/ship/resources/
fleet/skills/ship/resources/*
!fleet/skills/ship/resources/PR_TEMPLATE.md
!fleet/plugins/
fleet/plugins/*
# Explicit runtime names (also covered by fleet/* above; listed so the
# intent is visible and never weakened by a later whitelist edit).
fleet/service.json
fleet/cli.json
fleet/opencode.json
fleet/auth.json
fleet/*.env
fleet/*.log
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
